<title>USA: Tele-communications new German channels.</title>
<headline>Tele-communications new German channels.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>MultiThematiques, Tele-Communications International Inc 's European programming subsidiary, said Thursday it launched four new television channels in Germany.</p>
<p>It said it expects to offer three additional channels by the end of the year.</p>
<p>The new channels are called: PLANET, which airs documentary films; SEASONS, which is dedicated to hunting and fishing; and CINE CLASSICS I and CINE CLASSICS II, which airs films by famous directors and German premieres.</p>
<p>Tele-Communications International Inc is a division of Tele-Communications Inc.</p>
</text>
